WEBVTT

01:09.920 --> 01:11.039
Come on.

01:21.360 --> 01:22.720
Where are you going?

01:23.440 --> 01:24.600
To the North.

01:25.240 --> 01:26.039
For what?

01:27.600 --> 01:29.440
What can I do as a businessman?

01:29.440 --> 01:30.520
To do business.

01:35.080 --> 01:36.240
Cousin Lunar.

01:36.240 --> 01:37.360
Where are you going?

01:38.200 --> 01:39.240
Cut the crap.

01:42.280 --> 01:43.520
I gave you chicken drumsticks for nothing.

01:50.160 --> 01:51.880
The Imperial Family wants you to die.

01:52.000 --> 01:53.000
It wasn't me.

01:54.160 --> 01:56.280
I can't lose the Camp.

01:56.400 --> 01:57.680
Neither can the Shen Family.

02:01.600 --> 02:02.400
Hey.

02:03.760 --> 02:05.000
What kind of person

02:05.760 --> 02:07.240
your mother was?

02:12.400 --> 02:14.080
I have no mother since I was young.

02:14.680 --> 02:16.160
I have a family business since childhood.

02:16.600 --> 02:17.400
and family business.

02:18.079 --> 02:20.000
I dare not rest for a moment.

02:28.880 --> 02:30.000
I have a mother.

02:32.920 --> 02:34.040
but I don't.

02:34.760 --> 02:36.600
She's more like a courtesan.

02:38.280 --> 02:40.040
She never cares about my thoughts and feelings.

02:43.000 --> 02:44.720
They only urge me to work hard

02:46.120 --> 02:47.720
to think more about my family.

02:55.400 --> 02:56.560
But I think

02:56.880 --> 02:58.880
she loves me too.

02:59.560 --> 03:00.720
When I was young,

03:01.360 --> 03:03.960
she also sang a song to make me sleep.

03:05.560 --> 03:07.520
She made my favorite lotus seed soup.

03:13.640 --> 03:15.040
Lotus seed soup?

03:18.240 --> 03:19.800
Is it good?

03:38.120 --> 03:39.440
Cousin Lunar.

03:42.040 --> 03:43.360
Cousin Lunar!

03:44.920 --> 03:45.960
Shen Mingyue.

03:50.880 --> 03:51.960
What's wrong, Young Master?

03:52.480 --> 03:53.280
She’s gone.

03:53.280 --> 03:54.320
Did you see her go out?

03:55.079 --> 03:56.120
I fell asleep.

03:56.120 --> 03:57.960
But I didn't hear anything.

04:02.720 --> 04:03.960
It's normal

04:04.440 --> 04:05.720
she doesn't trust me.

04:19.839 --> 04:20.959
Your Highness.

04:22.280 --> 04:23.240
Lan Yu, you...

04:23.960 --> 04:25.960
It's nothing serious.

04:27.720 --> 04:28.440
Your Highness.

04:28.440 --> 04:29.680
The Huo family has been exiled.

04:29.680 --> 04:31.200
This is the route map.

04:33.760 --> 04:35.800
Looks like we're sending them to the North.

04:36.760 --> 04:37.840
More or less.

04:37.840 --> 04:38.880
Let Ao Jia match some good fighters.

04:38.880 --> 04:39.680
It's not a big problem.

04:41.680 --> 04:42.760
There's a wasteland here.

04:43.400 --> 04:44.920
It won't hurt the innocent.

04:44.920 --> 04:45.840
It's perfect for action.

04:46.320 --> 04:48.320
Yes, I'll make arrangements.

04:56.960 --> 04:58.520
I will come back eventually.

05:02.920 --> 05:03.840
Hurry up.

05:08.400 --> 05:09.080
Hurry up.

05:09.800 --> 05:10.440
Hurry up.

05:12.600 --> 05:13.560
Mother.

05:13.560 --> 05:14.240
Let's go.

05:14.240 --> 05:16.120
Sir, give us some water.

05:16.120 --> 05:18.080
Give us some water.

05:18.080 --> 05:19.200
Leave if there's no water.

05:19.200 --> 05:19.880
Hurry up.

05:35.200 --> 05:36.600
Your Highness.

05:38.440 --> 05:39.560
What brings you here?

05:43.400 --> 05:44.720
I don't want to see you die.

05:47.280 --> 05:48.080
Get up.

05:52.080 --> 05:52.880
Come with me.

06:06.600 --> 06:07.560
Mother.

06:11.320 --> 06:13.120
Your Highness.

06:17.480 --> 06:18.400
Ji Hong Zhen!

06:19.160 --> 06:20.120
Come out!

06:20.760 --> 06:23.320
Mother, you are so naughty.

06:28.600 --> 06:30.720
No wonder Father wants to take back the Camp.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.560
This is useful.

06:33.520 --> 06:34.480
You're a scoundrel. You can't use it as a bait. You're a scoundrel.

06:34.880 --> 06:36.200
How dare you use the Huo family as bait?

06:37.680 --> 06:41.040
It's because you love this Huo kid so much.

06:41.480 --> 06:43.840
You can't even escape, but you still want to save him.

06:43.840 --> 06:46.000
How can he take care of you

06:46.000 --> 06:47.280
can serve you?

06:47.600 --> 06:49.200
It's none of your business.

06:51.360 --> 06:52.440
Your Majesty, stay.

06:52.920 --> 06:54.200
Kill the rest.

08:14.520 --> 08:15.480
Blue Feather.

08:17.760 --> 08:19.120
Lan Yu.

08:29.040 --> 08:29.840
Mother.

08:30.560 --> 08:32.080
Come back to the palace with me.

08:35.880 --> 08:37.400
You're so naughty.

08:38.440 --> 08:40.520
Why did you take the Royal Seal?

08:40.520 --> 08:41.600
Give it to me.

08:43.960 --> 08:45.560
Your Highness.

08:46.040 --> 08:48.200
Ten years ago,

08:48.520 --> 08:51.320
you saved me from the dogs,

08:51.320 --> 08:54.560
and brought me into the Camp,

08:54.920 --> 08:56.720
Lan Yu believed

08:56.720 --> 09:01.240
to die for you.

09:02.320 --> 09:03.440
Your Highness.

09:08.560 --> 09:09.360
Lan Yu.

09:31.120 --> 09:32.000
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

09:32.160 --> 09:33.520
Forgive me, Your Majesty!

09:37.360 --> 09:38.200
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

09:38.520 --> 09:39.560
Shen Mingyue!

09:40.560 --> 09:42.120
Shen Mingyue!

11:25.480 --> 11:26.360
Zhao Jin.

11:28.160 --> 11:30.640
I know I’m handsome and handsome,

11:31.160 --> 11:32.320
but my cousin

11:32.320 --> 11:33.640
wouldn't have

11:33.640 --> 11:35.040
so blindly.

11:37.040 --> 11:38.640
White hair is your real hair.

11:41.080 --> 11:42.400
Let me see your black hair again.

11:43.600 --> 11:45.880
I have to give two rewards to watch acrobatics.

11:46.720 --> 11:48.520
My cousin is penniless now.

11:49.120 --> 11:50.120
How are you going to reward me?

11:59.880 --> 12:01.160
It was you

12:01.800 --> 12:02.520
was you, right?

12:06.480 --> 12:07.480
Cousin.

12:07.960 --> 12:08.920
Why do you say that?

12:12.160 --> 12:13.720
There's a butterfly birthmark

12:15.200 --> 12:17.040
on your wrist.

12:20.840 --> 12:21.640
It's not him.

12:24.000 --> 12:25.480
You must have mistaken me for someone else.

12:26.520 --> 12:27.560
He Lian Jin.

12:27.560 --> 12:28.240
What are you afraid of?

12:28.560 --> 12:29.480
So what?

12:29.840 --> 12:31.000
Do you dare to admit it?

12:32.160 --> 12:32.840
No.

12:33.160 --> 12:34.600
She obviously doesn't trust me now.

12:35.080 --> 12:37.720
If I told her that I was the one who had the spring breeze that night,

12:38.160 --> 12:39.920
she would kill me immediately.

12:42.160 --> 12:43.240
Settlement?

12:43.360 --> 12:44.560
Change.

12:44.840 --> 12:46.320
and a crouch.

12:47.400 --> 12:48.520
You can

12:48.520 --> 12:49.800
in sorcery.

12:50.160 --> 12:51.560
You must not be Nobody.

12:53.080 --> 12:53.880
Who are you?

13:14.720 --> 13:16.360
What do you want to do?

13:16.760 --> 13:18.480
What do you want me to do to you?

13:20.000 --> 13:21.680
What do you dare to do?

13:23.320 --> 13:24.720
I dare to do

13:25.360 --> 13:26.920
to do.

13:44.960 --> 13:45.800
All right.

13:46.040 --> 13:47.240
I did it on purpose.

13:47.800 --> 13:49.400
I saw you overused your magic

13:49.720 --> 13:50.720
and your blood stopped.

13:50.960 --> 13:51.760
I'll give you some internal force.

13:52.480 --> 13:53.240
Otherwise,

13:53.240 --> 13:54.800
you'll be blind.

13:55.400 --> 13:56.720
Such a beautiful girl

13:57.080 --> 13:58.920
It's a pity to be blind.

13:59.760 --> 14:01.960
Do I have to be grateful to you?

14:10.520 --> 14:12.280
Is this dagger from the Heavenly Camp?

14:13.000 --> 14:14.680
I can't recover in a month

14:15.480 --> 14:18.040
I can't recover in a month.

14:19.120 --> 14:19.920
Are you still angry?

14:22.160 --> 14:23.240
If you dare to offend me again,

14:23.800 --> 14:24.640
I'll kill you.

14:31.840 --> 14:33.800
I knew I shouldn't tell her.

14:34.000 --> 14:34.800
Otherwise,

14:35.000 --> 14:36.360
she will kill me.

14:49.200 --> 14:50.680
Mr. Zhao's hair

14:53.400 --> 14:54.320
is a disguise.

14:59.400 --> 15:00.760
Mr. Zhao's identity is a mystery.

15:01.720 --> 15:03.320
Now he wants to go to the North with us.

15:03.800 --> 15:05.000
I'm afraid he's up to no good.

15:06.720 --> 15:07.920
Worried about me?

15:08.480 --> 15:10.160
Your safety is important.

15:14.040 --> 15:15.040
The night before you were arrested,

15:15.040 --> 15:16.120
I summoned you to the palace.

15:16.560 --> 15:18.280
When did you leave the palace at night?

15:19.040 --> 15:19.960
At midnight.

15:20.480 --> 15:21.640
Where were you before leaving the palace?

15:22.200 --> 15:24.160
In the study of Fengyi Palace.

15:24.480 --> 15:25.760
Is there anyone with you?

15:26.400 --> 15:27.280
No.

15:27.280 --> 15:28.360
I was alone.

15:33.960 --> 15:34.960
What's wrong?

15:36.600 --> 15:37.400
Nothing.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.440
That night,

15:39.680 --> 15:41.160
someone

15:41.160 --> 15:43.120
stole the ledger of the gold case.

15:43.800 --> 15:44.920
I’m sure

15:44.920 --> 15:46.160
that person is Zhao Jin.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.320
But besides him,

15:48.720 --> 15:50.080
another thief

15:50.640 --> 15:52.040
broke into my palace.

15:55.280 --> 15:56.600
Can I see your wrist?

15:58.640 --> 15:59.680
Your Highness, please behave yourself.

16:11.280 --> 16:12.400
Leave now.

16:12.480 --> 16:13.680
Pull and pull.

16:13.680 --> 16:14.720
Waiting for pursuers?
